WEBVTT

00:08:27.830 --> 00:08:30.330
small government conservatives, liberals,

00:08:30.363 --> 00:08:32.963
the Indigenous people's party,
the Green Party.

00:08:33.363 --> 00:08:34.597
And I recently asked him,

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:38.130
what does it take to bring
a group like that together

00:08:38.163 --> 00:08:40.463
but hold them together?

00:08:41.097 --> 00:08:46.063
He said, "Someone, you,
has to take responsibility

00:08:46.097 --> 00:08:49.263
for reminding them
of their shared purpose:

00:08:49.730 --> 00:08:51.230
caring for people.”

00:08:52.397 --> 00:08:57.697
If we are more focused
on what makes us different than the same,

00:08:57.730 --> 00:09:00.697
then every debate is a fight.